      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "84ab847b-1bad-5351-8718-5cf62bff28a4",
      "content": "팀 분위기는 어떻습니까?\n불화설도 돌던데요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "How's the mood in the team?\nThere have been rumors of friction.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f0432218-5ded-5560-84c9-64b02fd2bcf2",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "기자회견 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "1cdba7a1-8ee6-5a3f-ad40-69445382ddc5"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "7301a912-0ecd-5f07-ac5b-8cb2836f68c5": "press",
        "fd86dc9f-7263-5940-9a1c-fb6397e6a35a": -1,
        "7e72bf83-899a-51b2-93cd-8ba49b5c246d": 0,
        "c4aa2f03-4fac-5d54-91ab-d15276990f62": "",
        "a25d54e8-c965-578b-98a1-350314dc0f30": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3f4c10e7-50b3-58b9-8d91-0e0bdd9bb5ee",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "03e78d2f-cb24-5a06-bd97-028712dbe687",
          "text": "가족 같은 분위기입니다.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "e814137e-781c-5ddf-bb31-344bec14c584": "ok>trust_all:+2;ng>trust_all:-1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "9d9084fc-03e2-54d5-afb4-acadf732f0ef",
          "text": "경쟁은 있지만 건강한 경쟁입니다.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "e814137e-781c-5ddf-bb31-344bec14c584": "trust_all:+1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "0ffc3ec1-6694-59d5-8399-592d2b0972da",
          "text": "근거 없는 소문엔 답하지 않겠습니다.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "e814137e-781c-5ddf-bb31-344bec14c584": "smod:mental:+1:1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:03e78d2f-cb24-5a06-bd97-028712dbe687": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "We're like a family.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:9d9084fc-03e2-54d5-afb4-acadf732f0ef": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "There's competition, but it's healthy competition.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:0ffc3ec1-6694-59d5-8399-592d2b0972da": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I won't respond to baseless rumors.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
